<title>USA: EG&amp;G Inc Q1 shr decreases.</title>
<headline>EG&amp;G Inc Q1 shr decreases.</headline>
<dateline>WELLESLEY, Mass. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Call mean estimate for Q1 was $0.21 per share.</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.21		    $0.25</p>
<p> Net shr		     0.22		     0.27</p>
<p> Net			 10,026		   12,782</p>
<p> Sales		    347,006		  346,791</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  46,220		   47,630</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q1 1997 net includes a gain of $0.01 per share from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>Q1 1996 includes a gain of $0.02 per share from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
